'''Electivire''' (Japanese: '''エレキブル''' ''Elekible'') is a {{ct|Lightning}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Space-Time Smackdown}} expansion.

