==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's {{TCGP|Space-Time Smackdown}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Burning Shadows|Electivire|43}} from the {{TCG|Burning Shadows}} expansion.
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-A}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Everyone's Exciting Battle|Electivire|18}} from the {{TCG|Everyone's Exciting Battle}} collection, which was only released in Japan.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

